1.28 cue stitch
1.43 cue stitch
1.58 cue stitch
1.73 cue stitch
1.88 cue stitch
2.03 cue stitch
2.18 cue stitch
2.33 cue stitch
2.48 cue stitch
2.63 cue stitch
2.63 rate COOL "Closed" +105 combo=1
4.23 -- after stitching: status=running vitals=99 score=105 combo=1 counts=1/0/0/0 live=[]
"
`;

